[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9481.349, "timestamp": "02:38:01", "text": "在这个里面？柳树失去了感觉。一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9485.349, "timestamp": "02:38:05", "text": "柳树，柳树。你真是根柳树吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9487.19, "timestamp": "02:38:07", "text": "是的。我发誓你说这话就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9490.07, "timestamp": "02:38:10", "text": "污点。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9493.75, "timestamp": "02:38:13", "text": "我们就像柳树一样，是吧？柳。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9500.63, "timestamp": "02:38:20", "text": "哦，人太多了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9504.15, "timestamp": "02:38:24", "text": "太多了。在哪里？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9507.19, "timestamp": "02:38:27", "text": "多少才算太多？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9511.75, "timestamp": "02:38:31", "text": "至少两个。两个就太多了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9514.469, "timestamp": "02:38:34", "text": "太多了。你说得对。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9517.19, "timestamp": "02:38:37", "text": "你知道吗？一个都嫌多。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9519.03, "timestamp": "02:38:39", "text": "这就是为什么你永远不会有两个总和的原因。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9526.389, "timestamp": "02:38:46", "text": "什么？一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9529.91, "timestamp": "02:38:49", "text": "真烂。整个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9531.75, "timestamp": "02:38:51", "text": "一个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9534.15, "timestamp": "02:38:54", "text": "好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9536.55, "timestamp": "02:38:56", "text": "哦，你觉得这样可以吗？好的。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9539.11, "timestamp": "02:38:59", "text": "知道了。所以，"}]